# Leave unset and the board lives in each browser's localStorage, with no
# sign-in — fine for one person on one machine.
#
# Set it and the app requires a login, and every window (Desk, Console, each
# teammate's browser) reads and writes one record through the relay in ./relay.
# No secret goes here: the browser holds only the session token it gets by
# signing in.
# VITE_RELAY_URL=https://stripe-sync.yourname.workers.dev
